---
import SectionHeading from '@/components/ui/SectionHeading.astro';
import { profile } from '@/data/profile';
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-4 py-16 sm:px-6">
  <SectionHeading eyebrow="About" title="Building the same product three ways" />
  <div class="mt-6 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-ink-muted">
    <p>{profile.positioning}</p>
    <p>
      A lot of my work comes back to one Brazilian Portuguese learning product that I&rsquo;ve
      built across desktop, mobile, and backend. Each version uses a different approach based on
      what that platform actually needs, rather than forcing the same architecture everywhere.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of that: {profile.currentlyBuilding}, reading Clean Architecture: A Craftsman&rsquo;s
      Guide to Software Structure and Design, and {' '}{profile.interests.join(', ')} when not at
      a keyboard.
    </p>
  </div>
  <a href="/about" class="hover-grow mt-6 text-sm font-medium text-accent">
    More about me &rarr;
  </a>
</section>
